      ],
      "text": "national tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        80.14349365234375,
        272.9559020996094,
        109.03948974609375
      ],
      "text": "D  I",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 24.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.07140350341797,
        87.01229095458984,
        349.18475341796875,
        107.23948669433594
      ],
      "text": "eclarations of nterest",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 16.799999237060547,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        130.963134765625,
        513.4143676757812,
        144.31463623046875
      ],
      "text": "The Guidelines Development Group (henceforth referred to as the Panel) was established",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        146.95965576171875,
        513.4029541015625,
        160.3111572265625
      ],
      "text": "to advise WHO throughout the entire process of the development of this guidance. The",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        162.9561767578125,
        513.4373779296875,
        176.30767822265625
      ],
      "text": "experts on the Panel and the institutions where they work, contributed time to the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        178.95269775390625,
        513.46044921875,
        192.30419921875
      ],
      "text": "various discussions and other activities involved in the update process. The External",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        194.94921875,
        372.1714172363281,
        208.30072021484375
      ],
      "text": "Review Group provided comments on the draft document.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        222.28472900390625,
        513.368408203125,
        235.63623046875
      ],
      "text": "Declaration of Interest forms were completed by all members of the Panel and the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        238.28125,
        513.3683471679688,
        251.63275146484375
      ],
      "text": "External Review Group, as well as by members of the academic centres that were",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        254.27777099609375,
        199.1999053955078,
        267.6292724609375
      ],
      "text": "involved in the reviews.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        294.9867248535156,
        95.04740142822266,
        316.31671142578125
      ],
      "text": "P",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold-SC700",
      "size": 18.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        95.31739807128906,
        300.03570556640625,
        194.96090698242188,
        314.9667053222656
      ],
      "text": "anel members",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold-SC700",
      "size": 12.600000381469727,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        319.3402099609375,
        352.3339538574219,
        332.69171142578125
      ],
      "text": "Six members of the Panel declared interests as follows:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        346.67572021484375,
        513.3799438476562,
        360.0272216796875
      ],
      "text": "Dr Susan Abdel-Rahman reported that her employer receives research support from",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        362.6722106933594,
        513.448974609375,
        376.0237121582031
      ],
      "text": "the United States National Institutes of Health for the development of dried blood",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        378.668701171875,
        513.4721069335938,
        392.02020263671875
      ],
      "text": "spot assays for monitoring anti-TB drugs (2011-2013). In addition, Dr Abdel-Rahman",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        394.6651916503906,
        476.3155212402344,
        408.0166931152344
      ],
      "text": "prepared technical reports for WHO evaluating current anti-TB dosing regimens.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        422.0007019042969,
        513.368408203125,
        435.3522033691406
      ],
      "text": "Dr Lisa Adams reported that colleagues in her research unit received research support",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        437.9971923828125,
        513.4490356445312,
        451.34869384765625
      ],
      "text": "from Oxford Immunotec Inc., the makers of the T-SPOT TB test. Dr Adams was involved",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        453.9936828613281,
        513.4146118164062,
        467.3451843261719
      ],
      "text": "in the study but reported receiving no remuneration or support from these research",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        469.99017333984375,
        513.3683471679688,
        483.3416748046875
      ],
      "text": "funds. Dr Adams is also involved in a TB CARE II Project, conducting an overview of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        485.9866638183594,
        513.4833984375,
        499.3381652832031
      ],
      "text": "systematic reviews of interventions to improve delivery of isoniazid preventive therapy",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        501.983154296875,
        513.4030151367188,
        515.3346557617188
      ],
      "text": "(IPT) to children who are TB contacts and/or HIV-positive with the intention of sharing",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        517.9796752929688,
        354.71441650390625,
        531.3311767578125
      ],
      "text": "these findings to inform development of this guidance.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        545.3151245117188,
        513.46044921875,
        558.6666259765625
      ],
      "text": "Dr Farhana Amanullah reported being employed at the Indus Hospital and having received",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        561.3116455078125,
        491.886474609375,
        574.6631469726562
      ],
      "text": "non-monetary support (in the form of paid travel) through the Stop TB Partnership.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        588.6471557617188,
        513.46044921875,
        601.9986572265625
      ],
      "text": "Dr Stephen Graham served as a technical advisor at WHO in preparation of the guidance",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        604.6436157226562,
        513.4031982421875,
        617.9951171875
      ],
      "text": "and received salary support from the International Union Against Tuberculosis and Lung",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        620.64013671875,
        513.4490356445312,
        633.9916381835938
      ],
      "text": "Disease for this work. Dr Graham also reported that he plans clinical and operational",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        636.6366577148438,
        513.41455078125,
        649.9881591796875
      ],
      "text": "research in childhood TB that is included in the future priority research agenda identified",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        652.6331787109375,
        221.1533660888672,
        665.9846801757812
      ],
      "text": "by this guideline document.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        679.9686889648438,
        513.4833374023438,
        693.3201904296875
      ],
      "text": "Dr Suzanne Hill reported being a former employee of WHO receiving support from the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        695.9651489257812,
        510.2061462402344,
        709.316650390625
      ],
      "text": "Gates Foundation to promote appropriate use of medicines in children, including anti-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        711.961669921875,
        195.6348876953125,
        725.3131713867188
      ],
      "text": "TB drugs (2008-2011).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        739.2971801757812,
        513.3915405273438,
        752.648681640625
      ],
      "text": "Professor Cleotilde How reported involvement in the review and publication of the new",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        755.2936401367188,
        501.2934875488281,
        768.6451416015625
      ],
      "text": "edition of a book on childhood TB, for which she received no financial remuneration.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        561.4338989257812,
        805.8439331054688,
        578.0939331054688,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "vii",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}